# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  What IS tracked (reference)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#  Tools/**/pyproject.toml   — dependency declarations
#  Tools/**/uv.lock          — pinned dependency lockfiles
#  Tools/**/*.py             — all MCP server source code
#  Tools/Text_Overlay_MCP/fonts/   — bundled OFL fonts (small TTFs)
#  Tools/LUT_Grading_MCP/**/luts/  — bundled .cube LUT presets (text files)
#  DaVinci_Scripts/**        — Fusion templates (.setting) and Lua scripts
#  DaVinci_Tools/**          — resolve-scripts, auto-subs, claude-resolve, etc.
#  *.md                      — all documentation
#  demo/                     — showcase clip embedded in README.md
#  manage-scripts.ps1        — DaVinci asset installer
